a de 7 días de 0.28 ppb. El viento venía de 108 grados a 4.3 mph. Hay 21 instalaciones grandes con permiso en el corredor viento arriba. Una de ellas, Shell Chemical, presentó el reporte 427322 por una emisión que empezó el 2024-07-31 y que, según el reporte, siguió hasta el 2024-08-04 12:45, hora local, pero el reporte no incluye benceno, así que no corresponde a esta lectura. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar qué causó esta lectura de benceno.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0069_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0069","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87626,"sha256":"bd475d9466e69723b686d3e130895cc15488f62bbdbb4ee951e8e57bb034214a","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:33+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0307_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87819,"sha256":"96c47bbe3564875b6b174ff098f2062